{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/15","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/15/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/15/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/15/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/15","id":6014961921,"node_id":"I_kwDOVV8PH88AAAABZoUJAQ","number":15,"title":"[High][NAV-001] Adaptive navigation silently discards per-navigation arguments","user":{"login":"Apdelrahman1911","id":104788132,"node_id":"U_kgDOBj7wpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104788132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12821064238,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHqLg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/area:nav","name":"area:nav","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: area:nav","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821065878,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHwlg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/audit","name":"audit","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: audit","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821066366,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHyfg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/evidence:confirmed-source","name":"evidence:confirmed-source","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: evidence:confirmed-source","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821068959,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DH8nw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/priority:high","name":"priority:high","color":"d93f0b","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: priority:high","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-24T16:15:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:00:44Z","closed_at":"2026-10-27T13:00:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- nativecmpkit-item:audit:NAV-001 -->\n## Classification\n- **Finding:** NAV-001\n- **Priority:** High\n- **Evidence status:** `confirmed-source` (source/test evidence is not automatically a demonstrated exploit)\n- **Affected modules:** `calf-navigation`\n- **Estimated complexity:** L\n- **Reviewed upstream baseline:** `af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6`; original commit preserved in this repository.\n\n## Exact code / symbols\n- [`calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/AdaptiveNavHostController.kt:16-25`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6/calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/AdaptiveNavHostController.kt#L16-L25) — `AdaptiveNavHostController.navigate/backStack`\n- [`calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/AdaptiveNavHost.kt:39-44`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6/calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/AdaptiveNavHost.kt#L39-L44) — `AdaptiveNavHost destination dispatch`\n- [`calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/NavDestination.kt:5-9`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6/calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/NavDestination.kt#L5-L9) — `NavDestination.arguments`\n\n## Root cause\nnavigate(route, arguments) appends only the route String. No entry or argument payload is stored; the host passes the graph destination's static Map<String, NavArgument> definition to content instead of a navigation entry's values.\n\n## Impact and preconditions\nCallers cannot send different argument values to two visits of the same route. The API accepts input that is never observed; saved/restored stacks likewise carry no arguments. The module is currently unpublished, which limits consumer exposure but not the defect.\n\n## Supporting evidence\n- All source locations refer to immutable baseline af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6.\n- Controller line24 uses only backStack.add(route).\n- Host line43 calls destination.content(destination.arguments); there is no lookup of the navigate arguments parameter.\n- No route interpolation/deep-link argument parser is wired into AdaptiveNavHost.\n\n## Recommended solution\nBefore stabilizing or publishing navigation, define a typed entry/payload contract distinct from argument schema; validate and merge defaults at navigation, expose resolved values to content, and implement a save/restore policy. Preserve or deprecate the current overload explicitly rather than silently dropping inputs.\n\n## Risks and compatibility\nChanging public types and saver format affects callers and restoration; do not hide the change in the identity migration. Never persist secrets or arbitrary unserializable objects by default.\n\n## Required tests / acceptance criteria\n- Navigate to one route with two distinct payloads; each visit receives its own values.\n- Validate missing, nullable, wrong-type and defaulted arguments.\n- Round-trip entry IDs and arguments through the saver; reject unsupported values predictably.\n\n## Dependencies\n- None identified.\n\n## Historical context\n- None identified.\nOriginal upstream records (authors, IDs, timestamps, comments, reviews and public revisions) are archived in [`docs/migration/upstream-metadata/`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/tree/main/docs/migration/upstream-metadata). Links above are attribution; this issue is newly created for the independent project, not an impersonated original.\n\n## Persistent technical record\n[`docs/audit/findings/NAV.json`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/findings/NAV.json) · [Audit](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/README.md) · [Roadmap](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/roadmap/README.md)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Apdelrahman1911","id":104788132,"node_id":"U_kgDOBj7wpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104788132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/15/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/15/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}